### Test Practice Exams API with AI Generation

# Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@courseId = 1
@studentId = 1
@token = your_jwt_token_here

### 1. Get weak skills for student
GET {{baseUrl}}/practice-exams/weak-skills
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Generate practice exam for a course (general questions)
POST {{baseUrl}}/practice-exams/courses/{{courseId}}/generate?questionCount=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Generate practice exam for a specific skill
POST {{baseUrl}}/practice-exams/courses/{{courseId}}/generate?skillTag=حلقه%20های%20تکرار&questionCount=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Submit practice exam answers (with AI-generated questions)
POST {{baseUrl}}/practice-exams/courses/{{courseId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": [
    {
      "questionId": -1,
      "choiceId": 0,
      "questionText": "متن سوال اول",
      "correctChoiceIndex": 0
    },
    {
      "questionId": -2,
      "choiceId": 1,
      "questionText": "متن سوال دوم",
      "correctChoiceIndex": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 5. Get practice exam results
GET {{baseUrl}}/practice-exams/results
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Get practice exam results for specific course
GET {{baseUrl}}/practice-exams/results?courseId={{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Get result details
GET {{baseUrl}}/practice-exams/results/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Compare progress
GET {{baseUrl}}/practice-exams/courses/{{courseId}}/progress-comparison?skillTag=حلقه%20های%20تکرار
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
